<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A process is an entity that is identifiable only through the unfolding of time, has temporal parts, and unless otherwise specified/predicted, cannot be identified from any instant of time in which it exists." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
