<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000017> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A realizable entity is an attribute that is exhibited under some condition and is realized in some process." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000017> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
